{"id":"n58552-1-7","stage":5,"title":"변화무쌍 · 变幻莫测","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58552-1-7-1","ko":"그때 한라산 근처에는 비가 왔는데 시내에는 해가 쨍쨍하더라고요.","zh":"那时候汉拿山附近正在下雨，而市区却阳光明媚呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그때","meaning":"那时，那时候","explanation":"그때：那时，那时候","readings":[{"term":"그때","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29683","senseId":"1","lemma":"그때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그때","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3"}},{"text":"한라산","meaning":"汉拿山","explanation":"한라산：汉拿山","readings":[{"term":"한라산","audio":"/audio/17874a8786b04d9b386a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한라산","audio":"/audio/17874a8786b04d9b386a.mp3"}},{"text":"근처에는","meaning":"附近，近处","explanation":"근처：附近，近处；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"근처","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62061","senseId":"1","lemma":"근처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"근처에는","audio":"/audio/91f1ccf138ad79af01bd.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"왔는데","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔는데","audio":"/audio/00521fca05afdb9d28ff.mp3"}},{"text":"시내에는","meaning":"市内，市里","explanation":"시내：市内，市里；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시내","audio":"/audio/47aebe2586c6cf8d52e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65118","senseId":"1","lemma":"시내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시내에는","audio":"/audio/618fbee5830d39094b78.mp3"}},{"text":"해가","meaning":"太阳","explanation":"해：太阳；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72468","senseId":"1","lemma":"해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해가","audio":"/audio/b47f44201b814682f91a.mp3"}},{"text":"쨍쨍하더라고요.","meaning":"火辣辣","explanation":"쨍쨍하다：火辣辣；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"쨍쨍하다","audio":"/audio/bb287b7da601a2691999.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91523","senseId":"1","lemma":"쨍쨍하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쨍쨍하더라고요","audio":"/audio/18ec26b98a37ca4e3f03.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2d0b6f3e4d1966c4","term":"그때","zh":"那时，那时候","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3","entryId":"29683","definition":"前面所说的某一时间。","pronunciation":["그때"]},{"id":"e44b07ac25b977cc","term":"근처","zh":"附近，近处","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3","entryId":"62061","definition":"以某场所、东西或人为中心，较近的地方。","pronunciation":["근ː처"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"47aebe2586c6cf8d","term":"시내","zh":"市内，市里","audio":"/audio/47aebe2586c6cf8d52e3.mp3","entryId":"65118","definition":"城市里面。","pronunciation":["시ː내"]},{"id":"b4ec4274b7799f1f","term":"해","zh":"太阳","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3","entryId":"72468","definition":"位于太阳系的中心，温度极高，自行发光的恒星。","pronunciation":["해"]},{"id":"bb287b7da601a269","term":"쨍쨍하다","zh":"火辣辣","audio":"/audio/bb287b7da601a2691999.mp3","entryId":"91523","definition":"阳光等毒辣地照射的状态。","pronunciation":["쨍쨍하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a2d54b896602681f983f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58552-1-7-2","ko":"섬 날씨는 그야말로 변화무쌍